{
  "_id": "lJA2d03AFyDyU4Yg",
  "name": "Sundial of Eternal Dusk",
  "type": "equipment",
  "img": "icons/sundries/lights/lantern-iron-lit-yellow.webp",
  "folder": "RTbervUSHs1Dr8d6",
  "sort": 0,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Despite its name, a Sundial of Eternal Dusk looks more like a lantern than a sundial: a rough shard of green saronite hangs above an iron cylinder flanked by wings of sculpted brass, glowing green gas billows between the shard and the cylinder, and a smaller green shard bobs between two forked prongs at the bottom. A curved handle above the larger shard lets you hold it easily in one hand. While you hold the sundial, you know what time it is.</p><p><strong>Spellcasting Focus.</strong> You can use the sundial as a Spellcasting Focus for your spells.</p><p><strong>Cloak of Shadows.</strong> The sundial fills your space with Dim Light, making it Lightly Obscured and giving you Resistance to Radiant damage. The shadow doesn't obscure your own vision.</p><p><strong>Spells.</strong> The sundial has 20 charges and regains 1d6 + 3 expended charges daily at dawn. While holding it, you can cast one of the spells on the following table from it (save DC 19), expending the number of charges shown.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Spell</th><th>Charges</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDarkness00]{Darkness}</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDimensionD]{Dimension Door} (the destination must be in Dim Light or Darkness)</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplEvardsBlac]{Evard's Black Tentacles}</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFear000000]{Fear}</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.azhfcdy96idtT6uT]{Hunger of Hadar}</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplPhantasmal]{Phantasmal Killer}</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.EX24QkNdCeUOAeeV]{Summon Undead}</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.srWTUnOXAd1qrtHB]{Toll the Dead}</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplTrueSeeing]{True Seeing}</td><td>6</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
